     "note": "The table is generated from the full quasi-Debye free energy and the Appendix-B polynomial is stated to be consistent with it, so sub-GPa RMS rather than printed-rounding equality is the appropriate check. A diagnostic least-squares refit of c0-c5 to the tabulated derived grid lowers RMSE only to 0.445789 GPa; it is not a refit to primary observations and is not stored as an EOS record."
    }
